('Ps.119.83', 'BSB', 'Though I am like a wineskin dried up by smoke, I do not forget Your statutes.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.84', 'BSB', 'How many days must Your servant wait? When will You execute judgment on my persecutors?', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.85', 'BSB', 'The arrogant have dug pits for me in violation of Your law.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.86', 'BSB', 'All Your commandments are faithful; I am persecuted without cause—help me!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.87', 'BSB', 'They almost wiped me from the earth, but I have not forsaken Your precepts.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.88', 'BSB', 'Revive me according to Your loving devotion, that I may obey the testimony of Your mouth.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.89', 'BSB', 'Your word, O LORD, is everlasting; it is firmly fixed in the heavens.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.90', 'BSB', 'Your faithfulness continues through all generations; You established the earth, and it endures.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.91', 'BSB', 'Your ordinances stand to this day, for all things are servants to You.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.92', 'BSB', 'If Your law had not been my delight, then I would have perished in my affliction.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.93', 'BSB', 'I will never forget Your precepts, for by them You have revived me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.94', 'BSB', 'I am Yours; save me, for I have sought Your precepts.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.95', 'BSB', 'The wicked wait to destroy me, but I will ponder Your testimonies.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.96', 'BSB', 'I have seen a limit to all perfection, but Your commandment is without limit.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.97', 'BSB', 'Oh, how I love Your law! All day long it is my meditation.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.98', 'BSB', 'Your commandments make me wiser than my enemies, for they are always with me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.99', 'BSB', 'I have more insight than all my teachers, for Your testimonies are my meditation.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.100', 'BSB', 'I discern more than the elders, for I obey Your precepts.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.101', 'BSB', 'I have kept my feet from every evil path, that I may keep Your word.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.102', 'BSB', 'I have not departed from Your ordinances, for You Yourself have taught me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.103', 'BSB', 'How sweet are Your words to my taste— sweeter than honey in my mouth!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.104', 'BSB', 'I gain understanding from Your precepts; therefore I hate every false way.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.105', 'BSB', 'Your word is a lamp to my feet and a light to my path.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.106', 'BSB', 'I have sworn and confirmed that I will keep Your righteous judgments.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.107', 'BSB', 'I am severely afflicted, O LORD; revive me through Your word.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.108', 'BSB', 'Accept the freewill offerings of my mouth, O LORD, and teach me Your judgments.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.109', 'BSB', 'I constantly take my life in my hands, yet I do not forget Your law.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.110', 'BSB', 'The wicked have set a snare for me, but I have not strayed from Your precepts.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.111', 'BSB', 'Your testimonies are my heritage forever, for they are the joy of my heart.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.112', 'BSB', 'I have inclined my heart to perform Your statutes, even to the very end.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.113', 'BSB', 'The double-minded I despise, but Your law I love.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.114', 'BSB', 'You are my hiding place and my shield; I put my hope in Your word.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.115', 'BSB', 'Depart from me, you evildoers, that I may obey the commandments of my God.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.116', 'BSB', 'Sustain me as You promised, that I may live; let me not be ashamed of my hope.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.117', 'BSB', 'Uphold me, and I will be saved, that I may always regard Your statutes.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.118', 'BSB', 'You reject all who stray from Your statutes, for their deceitfulness is in vain.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.119', 'BSB', 'All the wicked on earth You discard like dross; therefore I love Your testimonies.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.120', 'BSB', 'My flesh trembles in awe of You; I stand in fear of Your judgments.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.121', 'BSB', 'I have done what is just and right; do not leave me to my oppressors.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.122', 'BSB', 'Ensure Your servant’s well-being; do not let the arrogant oppress me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.123', 'BSB', 'My eyes fail, looking for Your salvation, and for Your righteous promise.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.124', 'BSB', 'Deal with Your servant according to Your loving devotion, and teach me Your statutes.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.125', 'BSB', 'I am Your servant; give me understanding, that I may know Your testimonies.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.126', 'BSB', 'It is time for the LORD to act, for they have broken Your law.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.127', 'BSB', 'Therefore I love Your commandments more than gold, even the purest gold.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.128', 'BSB', 'Therefore I admire all Your precepts and hate every false way.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.129', 'BSB', 'Wonderful are Your testimonies; therefore I obey them.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.130', 'BSB', 'The unfolding of Your words gives light; it informs the simple.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.131', 'BSB', 'I open my mouth and pant, longing for Your commandments.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.132', 'BSB', 'Turn to me and show me mercy, as You do to those who love Your name.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.133', 'BSB', 'Order my steps in Your word; let no sin rule over me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.134', 'BSB', 'Redeem me from the oppression of man, that I may keep Your precepts.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.135', 'BSB', 'Make Your face shine upon Your servant, and teach me Your statutes.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.136', 'BSB', 'My eyes shed streams of tears because Your law is not obeyed.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.137', 'BSB', 'Righteous are You, O LORD, and upright are Your judgments.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.138', 'BSB', 'The testimonies You have laid down are righteous and altogether faithful.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.139', 'BSB', 'My zeal has consumed me because my foes forget Your words.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.140', 'BSB', 'Your promise is completely pure; therefore Your servant loves it.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.141', 'BSB', 'I am lowly and despised, but I do not forget Your precepts.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.142', 'BSB', 'Your righteousness is everlasting and Your law is true.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.143', 'BSB', 'Trouble and distress have found me, but Your commandments are my delight.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.144', 'BSB', 'Your testimonies are righteous forever. Give me understanding, that I may live.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.145', 'BSB', 'I call with all my heart; answer me, O LORD! I will obey Your statutes.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.146', 'BSB', 'I call to You; save me, that I may keep Your testimonies.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.147', 'BSB', 'I rise before dawn and cry for help; in Your word I have put my hope.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.148', 'BSB', 'My eyes anticipate the watches of night, that I may meditate on Your word.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.149', 'BSB', 'Hear my voice, O LORD, according to Your loving devotion; give me life according to Your justice.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.150', 'BSB', 'Those who follow after wickedness draw near; they are far from Your law.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.151', 'BSB', 'You are near, O LORD, and all Your commandments are true.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.152', 'BSB', 'Long ago I learned from Your testimonies that You have established them forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.153', 'BSB', 'Look upon my affliction and rescue me, for I have not forgotten Your law.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.154', 'BSB', 'Defend my cause and redeem me; revive me according to Your word.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.155', 'BSB', 'Salvation is far from the wicked because they do not seek Your statutes.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.156', 'BSB', 'Great are Your mercies, O LORD; revive me according to Your ordinances.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.157', 'BSB', 'Though my persecutors and foes are many, I have not turned from Your testimonies.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.158', 'BSB', 'I look on the faithless with loathing because they do not keep Your word.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.159', 'BSB', 'Consider how I love Your precepts, O LORD; give me life according to Your loving devotion.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.160', 'BSB', 'The entirety of Your word is truth, and all Your righteous judgments endure forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.161', 'BSB', 'Rulers persecute me without cause, but my heart fears only Your word.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.162', 'BSB', 'I rejoice in Your promise like one who finds great spoil.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.163', 'BSB', 'I hate and abhor falsehood, but Your law I love.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.164', 'BSB', 'Seven times a day I praise You for Your righteous judgments.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.165', 'BSB', 'Abundant peace belongs to those who love Your instruction; nothing can make them stumble.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.166', 'BSB', 'I wait for Your salvation, O LORD, and I carry out Your commandments.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.167', 'BSB', 'I obey Your testimonies and love them greatly.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.168', 'BSB', 'I obey Your precepts and Your testimonies, for all my ways are before You.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.169', 'BSB', 'May my cry come before You, O LORD; give me understanding according to Your word.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.170', 'BSB', 'May my plea come before You; rescue me according to Your promise.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.171', 'BSB', 'My lips pour forth praise, for You teach me Your statutes.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.172', 'BSB', 'My tongue sings of Your word, for all Your commandments are righteous.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.173', 'BSB', 'May Your hand be ready to help me, for I have chosen Your precepts.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.174', 'BSB', 'I long for Your salvation, O LORD, and Your law is my delight.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.175', 'BSB', 'Let me live to praise You; may Your judgments sustain me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.119.176', 'BSB', 'I have strayed like a lost sheep; seek Your servant, for I have not forgotten Your commandments.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.120.1', 'BSB', 'In my distress I cried to the LORD, and He answered me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.120.2', 'BSB', 'Deliver my soul, O LORD, from lying lips and a deceitful tongue.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.120.3', 'BSB', 'What will He do to you, and what will be added to you, O deceitful tongue?', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.120.4', 'BSB', 'Sharp arrows will come from the warrior, with burning coals of the broom tree!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.120.5', 'BSB', 'Woe to me that I dwell in Meshech, that I live among the tents of Kedar!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.120.6', 'BSB', 'Too long have I dwelt among those who hate peace.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.120.7', 'BSB', 'I am in favor of peace; but when I speak, they want war.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.121.1', 'BSB', 'I lift up my eyes to the hills. From where does my help come?', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.121.2', 'BSB', 'My help comes from the LORD, the Maker of heaven and earth.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.121.3', 'BSB', 'He will not allow your foot to slip; your Protector will not slumber.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.121.4', 'BSB', 'Behold, the Protector of Israel will neither slumber nor sleep.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.121.5', 'BSB', 'The LORD is your keeper; the LORD is the shade on your right hand.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.121.6', 'BSB', 'The sun will not strike you by day, nor the moon by night.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.121.7', 'BSB', 'The LORD will guard you from all evil; He will preserve your soul.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.121.8', 'BSB', 'The LORD will watch over your coming and going, both now and forevermore.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.122.1', 'BSB', 'I was glad when they said to me, “Let us go to the house of the LORD.”', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.122.2', 'BSB', 'Our feet are standing in your gates, O Jerusalem.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.122.3', 'BSB', 'Jerusalem is built up as a city united together,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.122.4', 'BSB', 'where the tribes go up, the tribes of the LORD, as a testimony for Israel, to give thanks to the name of the LORD.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.122.5', 'BSB', 'For there the thrones of judgment stand, the thrones of the house of David.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.122.6', 'BSB', 'Pray for the peace of Jerusalem: “May those who love you prosper.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.122.7', 'BSB', 'May there be peace within your walls, and prosperity inside your fortresses.”', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.122.8', 'BSB', 'For the sake of my brothers and friends, I will say, “Peace be within you.”', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.122.9', 'BSB', 'For the sake of the house of the LORD our God, I will seek your prosperity.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.123.1', 'BSB', 'I lift up my eyes to You, the One enthroned in heaven.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.123.2', 'BSB', 'As the eyes of servants look to the hand of their master, as the eyes of a maidservant look to the hand of her mistress, so our eyes are on the LORD our God until He shows us mercy.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.123.3', 'BSB', 'Have mercy on us, O LORD, have mercy, for we have endured much contempt.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.123.4', 'BSB', 'We have endured much scorn from the arrogant, much contempt from the proud.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.124.1', 'BSB', 'If the LORD had not been on our side— let Israel now declare—', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.124.2', 'BSB', 'if the LORD had not been on our side when men attacked us,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.124.3', 'BSB', 'when their anger flared against us, then they would have swallowed us alive,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.124.4', 'BSB', 'then the floods would have engulfed us, then the torrent would have overwhelmed us,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.124.5', 'BSB', 'then the raging waters would have swept us away.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.124.6', 'BSB', 'Blessed be the LORD, who has not given us as prey to their teeth.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.124.7', 'BSB', 'We have escaped like a bird from the snare of the fowler; the net is torn, and we have slipped away.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.124.8', 'BSB', 'Our help is in the name of the LORD, the Maker of heaven and earth.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.125.1', 'BSB', 'Those who trust in the LORD are like Mount Zion. It cannot be moved; it abides forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.125.2', 'BSB', 'As the mountains surround Jerusalem, so the LORD surrounds His people, both now and forevermore.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.125.3', 'BSB', 'For the scepter of the wicked will not rest upon the land allotted to the righteous, so that the righteous will not put forth their hands to injustice.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.125.4', 'BSB', 'Do good, O LORD, to those who are good, and to the upright in heart.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.125.5', 'BSB', 'But those who turn to crooked ways the LORD will banish with the evildoers. Peace be upon Israel.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.126.1', 'BSB', 'When the LORD restored the captives of Zion, we were like dreamers.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.126.2', 'BSB', 'Then our mouths were filled with laughter, our tongues with shouts of joy. Then it was said among the nations, “The LORD has done great things for them.”', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.126.3', 'BSB', 'The LORD has done great things for us; we are filled with joy.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.126.4', 'BSB', 'Restore our captives, O LORD, like streams in the Negev.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.126.5', 'BSB', 'Those who sow in tears will reap with shouts of joy.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.126.6', 'BSB', 'He who goes out weeping, bearing a trail of seed, will surely return with shouts of joy, carrying sheaves of grain.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.127.1', 'BSB', 'Unless the LORD builds the house, its builders labor in vain; unless the LORD protects the city, its watchmen stand guard in vain.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.127.2', 'BSB', 'In vain you rise early and stay up late, toiling for bread to eat— for He gives sleep to His beloved.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.127.3', 'BSB', 'Children are indeed a heritage from the LORD, and the fruit of the womb is His reward.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.127.4', 'BSB', 'Like arrows in the hand of a warrior, so are children born in one’s youth.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.127.5', 'BSB', 'Blessed is the man whose quiver is full of them. He will not be put to shame when he confronts the enemies at the gate.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.128.1', 'BSB', 'Blessed are all who fear the LORD, who walk in His ways!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.128.2', 'BSB', 'For when you eat the fruit of your labor, blessings and prosperity will be yours.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.128.3', 'BSB', 'Your wife will be like a fruitful vine flourishing within your house, your sons like olive shoots sitting around your table.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.128.4', 'BSB', 'In this way indeed shall blessing come to the man who fears the LORD.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.128.5', 'BSB', 'May the LORD bless you from Zion, that you may see the prosperity of Jerusalem all the days of your life,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.128.6', 'BSB', 'that you may see your children’s children. Peace be upon Israel!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.129.1', 'BSB', 'Many a time they have persecuted me from my youth— let Israel now declare—', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.129.2', 'BSB', 'many a time they have persecuted me from my youth, but they have not prevailed against me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.129.3', 'BSB', 'The plowmen plowed over my back; they made their furrows long.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.129.4', 'BSB', 'The LORD is righteous; He has cut me from the cords of the wicked.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.129.5', 'BSB', 'May all who hate Zion be turned back in shame.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.129.6', 'BSB', 'May they be like grass on the rooftops, which withers before it can grow,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.129.7', 'BSB', 'unable to fill the hands of the reaper, or the arms of the binder of sheaves.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.129.8', 'BSB', 'May none who pass by say to them, “The blessing of the LORD be on you; we bless you in the name of the LORD.”', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.130.1', 'BSB', 'Out of the depths I cry to You, O LORD!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.130.2', 'BSB', 'O Lord, hear my voice; let Your ears be attentive to my plea for mercy.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.130.3', 'BSB', 'If You, O LORD, kept track of iniquities, then who, O Lord, could stand?', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.130.4', 'BSB', 'But with You there is forgiveness, so that You may be feared.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.130.5', 'BSB', 'I wait for the LORD; my soul does wait, and in His word I put my hope.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.130.6', 'BSB', 'My soul waits for the Lord more than watchmen wait for the morning— more than watchmen wait for the morning.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.130.7', 'BSB', 'O Israel, put your hope in the LORD, for with the LORD is loving devotion, and with Him is redemption in abundance.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.130.8', 'BSB', 'And He will redeem Israel from all iniquity.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.131.1', 'BSB', 'My heart is not proud, O LORD, my eyes are not haughty. I do not aspire to great things or matters too lofty for me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.131.2', 'BSB', 'Surely I have stilled and quieted my soul; like a weaned child with his mother, like a weaned child is my soul within me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.131.3', 'BSB', 'O Israel, put your hope in the LORD, both now and forevermore.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.132.1', 'BSB', 'O LORD, remember on behalf of David all the hardships he endured,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.132.2', 'BSB', 'how he swore an oath to the LORD, and vowed to the Mighty One of Jacob:', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.132.3', 'BSB', '“I will not enter my house or get into my bed,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.132.4', 'BSB', 'I will not give sleep to my eyes or slumber to my eyelids,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.132.5', 'BSB', 'until I find a place for the LORD, a dwelling for the Mighty One of Jacob.”', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.132.6', 'BSB', 'We heard that the ark was in Ephrathah; we found it in the fields of Jaar.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.132.7', 'BSB', 'Let us go to His dwelling place; let us worship at His footstool.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.132.8', 'BSB', 'Arise, O LORD, to Your resting place, You and the ark of Your strength.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.132.9', 'BSB', 'May Your priests be clothed with righteousness, and Your saints shout for joy.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.132.10', 'BSB', 'For the sake of Your servant David, do not reject Your anointed one.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.132.11', 'BSB', 'The LORD swore an oath to David, a promise He will not revoke: “One of your descendants I will place on your throne.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.132.12', 'BSB', 'If your sons keep My covenant and the testimony I will teach them, then their sons will also sit on your throne forever and ever.”', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.132.13', 'BSB', 'For the LORD has chosen Zion; He has desired it for His home:', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.132.14', 'BSB', '“This is My resting place forever and ever; here I will dwell, for I have desired this home.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.132.15', 'BSB', 'I will bless her with abundant provisions; I will satisfy her poor with bread.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.132.16', 'BSB', 'I will clothe her priests with salvation, and her saints will sing out in joy.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.132.17', 'BSB', 'There I will make a horn grow for David; I have prepared a lamp for My anointed one.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.132.18', 'BSB', 'I will clothe his enemies with shame, but the crown upon him will gleam.”', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.133.1', 'BSB', 'Behold, how good and pleasant it is when brothers live together in harmony!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.133.2', 'BSB', 'It is like fine oil on the head, running down on the beard, running down Aaron’s beard over the collar of his robes.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.133.3', 'BSB', 'It is like the dew of Hermon falling on the mountains of Zion. For there the LORD has bestowed the blessing of life forevermore.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.134.1', 'BSB', 'Come, bless the LORD, all you servants of the LORD who serve by night in the house of the LORD!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.134.2', 'BSB', 'Lift up your hands to the sanctuary and bless the LORD!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.134.3', 'BSB', 'May the LORD, the Maker of heaven and earth, bless you from Zion.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.1', 'BSB', 'Hallelujah! Praise the name of the LORD. Give praise, O servants of the LORD,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.2', 'BSB', 'who stand in the house of the LORD, in the courts of the house of our God.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.3', 'BSB', 'Hallelujah, for the LORD is good; sing praises to His name, for it is lovely.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.4', 'BSB', 'For the LORD has chosen Jacob as His own, Israel as His treasured possession.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.5', 'BSB', 'For I know that the LORD is great; our Lord is above all gods.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.6', 'BSB', 'The LORD does all that pleases Him in the heavens and on the earth, in the seas and in all their depths.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.7', 'BSB', 'He causes the clouds to rise from the ends of the earth. He generates the lightning with the rain and brings forth the wind from His storehouses.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.8', 'BSB', 'He struck down the firstborn of Egypt, of both man and beast.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.9', 'BSB', 'He sent signs and wonders into your midst, O Egypt, against Pharaoh and all his servants.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.10', 'BSB', 'He struck down many nations and slaughtered mighty kings:', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.11', 'BSB', 'Sihon king of the Amorites, Og king of Bashan, and all the kings of Canaan.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.12', 'BSB', 'He gave their land as an inheritance, as a heritage to His people Israel.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.13', 'BSB', 'Your name, O LORD, endures forever, Your renown, O LORD, through all generations.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.14', 'BSB', 'For the LORD will vindicate His people and will have compassion on His servants.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.15', 'BSB', 'The idols of the nations are silver and gold, made by the hands of men.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.16', 'BSB', 'They have mouths, but cannot speak; they have eyes, but cannot see;', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.17', 'BSB', 'they have ears, but cannot hear; nor is there breath in their mouths.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.18', 'BSB', 'Those who make them become like them, as do all who trust in them.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.19', 'BSB', 'O house of Israel, bless the LORD; O house of Aaron, bless the LORD;', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.20', 'BSB', 'O house of Levi, bless the LORD; you who fear the LORD, bless the LORD!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.135.21', 'BSB', 'Blessed be the LORD from Zion— He who dwells in Jerusalem. Hallelujah!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.1', 'BSB', 'Give thanks to the LORD, for He is good. His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.2', 'BSB', 'Give thanks to the God of gods. His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.3', 'BSB', 'Give thanks to the Lord of lords. His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.4', 'BSB', 'He alone does great wonders. His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.5', 'BSB', 'By His insight He made the heavens. His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.6', 'BSB', 'He spread out the earth upon the waters. His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.7', 'BSB', 'He made the great lights— His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.8', 'BSB', 'the sun to rule the day, His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.9', 'BSB', 'the moon and stars to govern the night. His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.10', 'BSB', 'He struck down the firstborn of Egypt His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.11', 'BSB', 'and brought Israel out from among them His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.12', 'BSB', 'with a mighty hand and an outstretched arm. His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.13', 'BSB', 'He divided the Red Sea in two His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.14', 'BSB', 'and led Israel through the midst, His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.15', 'BSB', 'but swept Pharaoh and his army into the Red Sea. His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.16', 'BSB', 'He led His people through the wilderness. His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.17', 'BSB', 'He struck down great kings His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.18', 'BSB', 'and slaughtered mighty kings— His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.19', 'BSB', 'Sihon king of the Amorites His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.20', 'BSB', 'and Og king of Bashan— His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.21', 'BSB', 'and He gave their land as an inheritance, His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.22', 'BSB', 'a heritage to His servant Israel. His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.23', 'BSB', 'He remembered us in our low estate His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.24', 'BSB', 'and freed us from our enemies. His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.25', 'BSB', 'He gives food to every creature. His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.136.26', 'BSB', 'Give thanks to the God of heaven! His loving devotion endures forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.137.1', 'BSB', 'By the rivers of Babylon we sat and wept when we remembered Zion.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.137.2', 'BSB', 'There on the willows we hung our harps,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.137.3', 'BSB', 'for there our captors requested a song; our tormentors demanded songs of joy: “Sing us a song of Zion.”', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.137.4', 'BSB', 'How can we sing a song of the LORD in a foreign land?', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.137.5', 'BSB', 'If I forget you, O Jerusalem, may my right hand cease to function.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.137.6', 'BSB', 'May my tongue cling to the roof of my mouth if I do not remember you, if I do not exalt Jerusalem as my greatest joy!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.137.7', 'BSB', 'Remember, O LORD, the sons of Edom on the day Jerusalem fell: “Destroy it,” they said, “tear it down to its foundations!”', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.137.8', 'BSB', 'O Daughter of Babylon, doomed to destruction, blessed is he who repays you as you have done to us.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.137.9', 'BSB', 'Blessed is he who seizes your infants and dashes them against the rocks.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.138.1', 'BSB', 'I give You thanks with all my heart; before the gods I sing Your praises.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.138.2', 'BSB', 'I bow down toward Your holy temple and give thanks to Your name for Your loving devotion and Your faithfulness; You have exalted Your name and Your word above all else.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.138.3', 'BSB', 'On the day I called, You answered me; You emboldened me and strengthened my soul.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.138.4', 'BSB', 'All the kings of the earth will give You thanks, O LORD, when they hear the words of Your mouth.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.138.5', 'BSB', 'They will sing of the ways of the LORD, for the glory of the LORD is great.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.138.6', 'BSB', 'Though the LORD is on high, He attends to the lowly; but the proud He knows from afar.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.138.7', 'BSB', 'If I walk in the midst of trouble, You preserve me from the anger of my foes; You extend Your hand, and Your right hand saves me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.138.8', 'BSB', 'The LORD will fulfill His purpose for me. O LORD, Your loving devotion endures forever— do not abandon the works of Your hands.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.1', 'BSB', 'O LORD, You have searched me and known me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.2', 'BSB', 'You know when I sit and when I rise; You understand my thoughts from afar.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.3', 'BSB', 'You search out my path and my lying down; You are aware of all my ways.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.4', 'BSB', 'Even before a word is on my tongue, You know all about it, O LORD.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.5', 'BSB', 'You hem me in behind and before; You have laid Your hand upon me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.6', 'BSB', 'Such knowledge is too wonderful for me, too lofty for me to attain.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.7', 'BSB', 'Where can I go to escape Your Spirit? Where can I flee from Your presence?', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.8', 'BSB', 'If I ascend to the heavens, You are there; if I make my bed in Sheol, You are there.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.9', 'BSB', 'If I rise on the wings of the dawn, if I settle by the farthest sea,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.10', 'BSB', 'even there Your hand will guide me; Your right hand will hold me fast.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.11', 'BSB', 'If I say, “Surely the darkness will hide me, and the light become night around me”—', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.12', 'BSB', 'even the darkness is not dark to You, but the night shines like the day, for darkness is as light to You.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.13', 'BSB', 'For You formed my inmost being; You knit me together in my mother’s womb.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.14', 'BSB', 'I praise You, for I am fearfully and wonderfully made. Marvelous are Your works, and I know this very well.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.15', 'BSB', 'My frame was not hidden from You when I was made in secret, when I was woven together in the depths of the earth.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.16', 'BSB', 'Your eyes saw my unformed body; all my days were written in Your book and ordained for me before one of them came to be.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.17', 'BSB', 'How precious to me are Your thoughts, O God, how vast is their sum!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.18', 'BSB', 'If I were to count them, they would outnumber the grains of sand; and when I awake, I am still with You.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.19', 'BSB', 'O God, that You would slay the wicked— away from me, you bloodthirsty men—', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.20', 'BSB', 'who speak of You deceitfully; Your enemies take Your name in vain.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.21', 'BSB', 'Do I not hate those who hate You, O LORD, and detest those who rise against You?', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.22', 'BSB', 'I hate them with perfect hatred; I count them as my enemies.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.23', 'BSB', 'Search me, O God, and know my heart; test me and know my concerns.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.139.24', 'BSB', 'See if there is any offensive way in me; lead me in the way everlasting.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.140.1', 'BSB', 'Rescue me, O LORD, from evil men. Protect me from men of violence,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.140.2', 'BSB', 'who devise evil in their hearts and stir up war all day long.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.140.3', 'BSB', 'They sharpen their tongues like snakes; the venom of vipers is on their lips. Selah', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.140.4', 'BSB', 'Guard me, O LORD, from the hands of the wicked. Keep me safe from men of violence who scheme to make me stumble.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.140.5', 'BSB', 'The proud hide a snare for me; the cords of their net are spread along the path, and lures are set out for me. Selah', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.140.6', 'BSB', 'I say to the LORD, “You are my God.” Hear, O LORD, my cry for help.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.140.7', 'BSB', 'O GOD the Lord, the strength of my salvation, You shield my head in the day of battle.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.140.8', 'BSB', 'Grant not, O LORD, the desires of the wicked; do not promote their evil plans, lest they be exalted. Selah', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.140.9', 'BSB', 'May the heads of those who surround me be covered in the trouble their lips have caused.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.140.10', 'BSB', 'May burning coals fall on them; may they be thrown into the fire, into the miry pits, never to rise again.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.140.11', 'BSB', 'May no slanderer be established in the land; may calamity hunt down the man of violence.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.140.12', 'BSB', 'I know that the LORD upholds justice for the poor and defends the cause of the needy.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.140.13', 'BSB', 'Surely the righteous will praise Your name; the upright will dwell in Your presence.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.141.1', 'BSB', 'I call upon You, O LORD; come quickly to me. Hear my voice when I call to You.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.141.2', 'BSB', 'May my prayer be set before You like incense, my uplifted hands like the evening offering.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.141.3', 'BSB', 'Set a guard, O LORD, over my mouth; keep watch at the door of my lips.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.141.4', 'BSB', 'Do not let my heart be drawn to any evil thing or take part in works of wickedness with men who do iniquity; let me not feast on their delicacies.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.141.5', 'BSB', 'Let the righteous man strike me; let his rebuke be an act of loving devotion. It is oil for my head; let me not refuse it. For my prayer is ever against the deeds of the wicked.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.141.6', 'BSB', 'When their rulers are thrown down from the cliffs, the people will listen to my words, for they are pleasant.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.141.7', 'BSB', 'As when one plows and breaks up the soil, so our bones have been scattered at the mouth of Sheol.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.141.8', 'BSB', 'But my eyes are fixed on You, O GOD the Lord. In You I seek refuge; do not leave my soul defenseless.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.141.9', 'BSB', 'Keep me from the snares they have laid for me, and from the lures of evildoers.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.141.10', 'BSB', 'Let the wicked fall into their own nets, while I pass by in safety.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.142.1', 'BSB', 'I cry aloud to the LORD; I lift my voice to the LORD for mercy.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.142.2', 'BSB', 'I pour out my complaint before Him; I reveal my trouble to Him.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.142.3', 'BSB', 'Although my spirit grows faint within me, You know my way. Along the path I travel they have hidden a snare for me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.142.4', 'BSB', 'Look to my right and see; no one attends to me. There is no refuge for me; no one cares for my soul.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.142.5', 'BSB', 'I cry to You, O LORD: “You are my refuge, my portion in the land of the living.”', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.142.6', 'BSB', 'Listen to my cry, for I am brought quite low. Rescue me from my pursuers, for they are too strong for me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.142.7', 'BSB', 'Free my soul from prison, that I may praise Your name. The righteous will gather around me because of Your goodness to me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.143.1', 'BSB', 'O LORD, hear my prayer. In Your faithfulness, give ear to my plea; in Your righteousness, answer me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.143.2', 'BSB', 'Do not bring Your servant into judgment, for no one alive is righteous before You.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.143.3', 'BSB', 'For the enemy has pursued my soul, crushing my life to the ground, making me dwell in darkness like those long since dead.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.143.4', 'BSB', 'My spirit grows faint within me; my heart is dismayed inside me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.143.5', 'BSB', 'I remember the days of old; I meditate on all Your works; I consider the work of Your hands.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.143.6', 'BSB', 'I stretch out my hands to You; my soul thirsts for You like a parched land. Selah', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.143.7', 'BSB', 'Answer me quickly, O LORD; my spirit fails. Do not hide Your face from me, or I will be like those who descend to the Pit.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.143.8', 'BSB', 'Let me hear Your loving devotion in the morning, for I have put my trust in You. Teach me the way I should walk, for to You I lift up my soul.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.143.9', 'BSB', 'Deliver me from my enemies, O LORD; I flee to You for refuge.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.143.10', 'BSB', 'Teach me to do Your will, for You are my God. May Your good Spirit lead me on level ground.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.143.11', 'BSB', 'For the sake of Your name, O LORD, revive me. In Your righteousness, bring my soul out of trouble.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.143.12', 'BSB', 'And in Your loving devotion, cut off my enemies. Destroy all who afflict me, for I am Your servant.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.144.1', 'BSB', 'Blessed be the LORD, my Rock, who trains my hands for war, my fingers for battle.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.144.2', 'BSB', 'He is my steadfast love and my fortress, my stronghold and my deliverer. He is my shield, in whom I take refuge, who subdues peoples under me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.144.3', 'BSB', 'O LORD, what is man, that You regard him, the son of man that You think of him?', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.144.4', 'BSB', 'Man is like a breath; his days are like a passing shadow.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.144.5', 'BSB', 'Part Your heavens, O LORD, and come down; touch the mountains, that they may smoke.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.144.6', 'BSB', 'Flash forth Your lightning and scatter them; shoot Your arrows and rout them.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.144.7', 'BSB', 'Reach down from on high; set me free and rescue me from the deep waters, from the grasp of foreigners,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.144.8', 'BSB', 'whose mouths speak falsehood, whose right hands are deceitful.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.144.9', 'BSB', 'I will sing to You a new song, O God; on a harp of ten strings I will make music to You—', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.144.10', 'BSB', 'to Him who gives victory to kings, who frees His servant David from the deadly sword.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.144.11', 'BSB', 'Set me free and rescue me from the grasp of foreigners, whose mouths speak falsehood, whose right hands are deceitful.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.144.12', 'BSB', 'Then our sons will be like plants nurtured in their youth, our daughters like corner pillars carved to adorn a palace.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.144.13', 'BSB', 'Our storehouses will be full, supplying all manner of produce; our flocks will bring forth thousands, tens of thousands in our fields.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.144.14', 'BSB', 'Our oxen will bear great loads. There will be no breach in the walls, no going into captivity, and no cry of lament in our streets.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.144.15', 'BSB', 'Blessed are the people of whom this is so; blessed are the people whose God is the LORD.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.1', 'BSB', 'I will exalt You, my God and King; I will bless Your name forever and ever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.2', 'BSB', 'Every day I will bless You, and I will praise Your name forever and ever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.3', 'BSB', 'Great is the LORD and greatly to be praised; His greatness is unsearchable.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.4', 'BSB', 'One generation will commend Your works to the next, and will proclaim Your mighty acts—', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.5', 'BSB', 'the glorious splendor of Your majesty. And I will meditate on Your wondrous works.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.6', 'BSB', 'They will proclaim the power of Your awesome deeds, and I will declare Your greatness.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.7', 'BSB', 'They will extol the fame of Your abundant goodness and sing joyfully of Your righteousness.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.8', 'BSB', 'The LORD is gracious and compassionate, slow to anger and abounding in loving devotion.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.9', 'BSB', 'The LORD is good to all; His compassion rests on all He has made.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.10', 'BSB', 'All You have made will give You thanks, O LORD, and Your saints will bless You.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.11', 'BSB', 'They will tell of the glory of Your kingdom and speak of Your might,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.12', 'BSB', 'to make known to men Your mighty acts and the glorious splendor of Your kingdom.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.13', 'BSB', 'Your kingdom is an everlasting kingdom, and Your dominion endures through all generations. The LORD is faithful in all His words and kind in all His actions.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.14', 'BSB', 'The LORD upholds all who fall and lifts up all who are bowed down.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.15', 'BSB', 'The eyes of all look to You, and You give them their food in season.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.16', 'BSB', 'You open Your hand and satisfy the desire of every living thing.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.17', 'BSB', 'The LORD is righteous in all His ways and kind in all His deeds.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.18', 'BSB', 'The LORD is near to all who call on Him, to all who call out to Him in truth.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.19', 'BSB', 'He fulfills the desires of those who fear Him; He hears their cry and saves them.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.20', 'BSB', 'The LORD preserves all who love Him, but all the wicked He will destroy.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.145.21', 'BSB', 'My mouth will declare the praise of the LORD; let every creature bless His holy name forever and ever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.146.1', 'BSB', 'Hallelujah! Praise the LORD, O my soul.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.146.2', 'BSB', 'I will praise the LORD all my life; I will sing praises to my God while I have my being.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.146.3', 'BSB', 'Put not your trust in princes, in mortal man, who cannot save.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.146.4', 'BSB', 'When his spirit departs, he returns to the ground; on that very day his plans perish.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.146.5', 'BSB', 'Blessed is he whose help is the God of Jacob, whose hope is in the LORD his God,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.146.6', 'BSB', 'the Maker of heaven and earth, the sea, and everything in them. He remains faithful forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.146.7', 'BSB', 'He executes justice for the oppressed and gives food to the hungry. The LORD sets the prisoners free,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.146.8', 'BSB', 'the LORD opens the eyes of the blind, the LORD lifts those who are weighed down, the LORD loves the righteous.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.146.9', 'BSB', 'The LORD protects foreigners; He sustains the fatherless and the widow, but the ways of the wicked He frustrates.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.146.10', 'BSB', 'The LORD reigns forever, your God, O Zion, for all generations. Hallelujah!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.1', 'BSB', 'Hallelujah! How good it is to sing praises to our God, how pleasant and lovely to praise Him!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.2', 'BSB', 'The LORD builds up Jerusalem; He gathers the exiles of Israel.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.3', 'BSB', 'He heals the brokenhearted and binds up their wounds.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.4', 'BSB', 'He determines the number of the stars; He calls them each by name.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.5', 'BSB', 'Great is our Lord, and mighty in power; His understanding has no limit.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.6', 'BSB', 'The LORD sustains the humble, but casts the wicked to the ground.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.7', 'BSB', 'Sing to the LORD with thanksgiving; make music on the harp to our God,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.8', 'BSB', 'who covers the sky with clouds, who prepares rain for the earth, who makes grass to grow on the hills.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.9', 'BSB', 'He provides food for the animals, and for the young ravens when they call.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.10', 'BSB', 'He does not delight in the strength of the horse; He takes no pleasure in the legpower of the man.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.11', 'BSB', 'The LORD is pleased with those who fear Him, who hope in His loving devotion.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.12', 'BSB', 'Exalt the LORD, O Jerusalem; praise your God, O Zion!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.13', 'BSB', 'For He strengthens the bars of your gates and blesses the children within you.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.14', 'BSB', 'He makes peace at your borders; He fills you with the finest wheat.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.15', 'BSB', 'He sends forth His command to the earth; His word runs swiftly.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.16', 'BSB', 'He spreads the snow like wool; He scatters the frost like ashes;', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.17', 'BSB', 'He casts forth His hail like pebbles. Who can withstand His icy blast?', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.18', 'BSB', 'He sends forth His word and melts them; He unleashes His winds, and the waters flow.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.19', 'BSB', 'He declares His word to Jacob, His statutes and judgments to Israel.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.147.20', 'BSB', 'He has done this for no other nation; they do not know His judgments. Hallelujah!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.148.1', 'BSB', 'Hallelujah! Praise the LORD from the heavens; praise Him in the highest places.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.148.2', 'BSB', 'Praise Him, all His angels; praise Him, all His heavenly hosts.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.148.3', 'BSB', 'Praise Him, O sun and moon; praise Him, all you shining stars.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.148.4', 'BSB', 'Praise Him, O highest heavens, and you waters above the skies.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.148.5', 'BSB', 'Let them praise the name of the LORD, for He gave the command and they were created.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.148.6', 'BSB', 'He established them forever and ever; He issued a decree that will never pass away.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.148.7', 'BSB', 'Praise the LORD from the earth, all great sea creatures and ocean depths,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.148.8', 'BSB', 'lightning and hail, snow and clouds, powerful wind fulfilling His word,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.148.9', 'BSB', 'mountains and all hills, fruit trees and all cedars,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.148.10', 'BSB', 'wild animals and all cattle, crawling creatures and flying birds,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.148.11', 'BSB', 'kings of the earth and all peoples, princes and all rulers of the earth,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.148.12', 'BSB', 'young men and maidens, old and young together.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.148.13', 'BSB', 'Let them praise the name of the LORD, for His name alone is exalted; His splendor is above the earth and the heavens.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.148.14', 'BSB', 'He has raised up a horn for His people, the praise of all His saints, of Israel, a people near to Him. Hallelujah!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.149.1', 'BSB', 'Hallelujah! Sing to the LORD a new song— His praise in the assembly of the godly.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.149.2', 'BSB', 'Let Israel rejoice in their Maker; let the children of Zion rejoice in their King.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.149.3', 'BSB', 'Let them praise His name with dancing, and make music to Him with tambourine and harp.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.149.4', 'BSB', 'For the LORD takes pleasure in His people; He adorns the afflicted with salvation.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.149.5', 'BSB', 'Let the saints exult in glory; let them shout for joy upon their beds.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.149.6', 'BSB', 'May the high praises of God be in their mouths, and a double-edged sword in their hands,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.149.7', 'BSB', 'to inflict vengeance on the nations and punishment on the peoples,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.149.8', 'BSB', 'to bind their kings with chains and their nobles with shackles of iron,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.149.9', 'BSB', 'to execute the judgment written against them. This honor is for all His saints. Hallelujah!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.150.1', 'BSB', 'Hallelujah! Praise God in His sanctuary. Praise Him in His mighty heavens.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.150.2', 'BSB', 'Praise Him for His mighty acts; praise Him for His excellent greatness.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.150.3', 'BSB', 'Praise Him with the sound of the horn; praise Him with the harp and lyre.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.150.4', 'BSB', 'Praise Him with tambourine and dancing; praise Him with strings and flute.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.150.5', 'BSB', 'Praise Him with clashing cymbals; praise Him with resounding cymbals.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Ps.150.6', 'BSB', 'Let everything that has breath praise the LORD! Hallelujah!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.1', 'BSB', 'These are the proverbs of Solomon son of David, king of Israel,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.2', 'BSB', 'for gaining wisdom and discipline, for comprehending words of insight,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.3', 'BSB', 'and for receiving instruction in wise living and in righteousness, justice, and equity.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.4', 'BSB', 'To impart prudence to the simple and knowledge and discretion to the young,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.5', 'BSB', 'let the wise listen and gain instruction, and the discerning acquire wise counsel', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.6', 'BSB', 'by understanding the proverbs and parables, the sayings and riddles of the wise.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.7', 'BSB', 'The fear of the LORD is the beginning of knowledge, but fools despise wisdom and discipline.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.8', 'BSB', 'Listen, my son, to your father’s instruction, and do not forsake the teaching of your mother.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.9', 'BSB', 'For they are a garland of grace on your head and a pendant around your neck.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.10', 'BSB', 'My son, if sinners entice you, do not yield to them.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.11', 'BSB', 'If they say, “Come along, let us lie in wait for blood, let us ambush the innocent without cause,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.12', 'BSB', 'let us swallow them alive like Sheol, and whole like those descending into the Pit.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.13', 'BSB', 'We will find all manner of precious goods; we will fill our houses with plunder.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.14', 'BSB', 'Throw in your lot with us; let us all share one purse”—', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.15', 'BSB', 'my son, do not walk the road with them or set foot upon their path.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.16', 'BSB', 'For their feet run to evil, and they are swift to shed blood.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.17', 'BSB', 'How futile it is to spread the net where any bird can see it!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.18', 'BSB', 'But they lie in wait for their own blood; they ambush their own lives.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.19', 'BSB', 'Such is the fate of all who are greedy, whose unjust gain takes the lives of its possessors.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.20', 'BSB', 'Wisdom calls out in the street, she lifts her voice in the square;', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.21', 'BSB', 'in the main concourse she cries aloud, at the city gates she makes her speech:', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.22', 'BSB', '“How long, O simple ones, will you love your simple ways? How long will scoffers delight in their scorn and fools hate knowledge?', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.23', 'BSB', 'If you had repented at my rebuke, then surely I would have poured out my spirit on you; I would have made my words known to you.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.24', 'BSB', 'Because you refused my call, and no one took my outstretched hand,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.25', 'BSB', 'because you neglected all my counsel, and wanted none of my correction,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.26', 'BSB', 'in turn I will mock your calamity; I will sneer when terror strikes you,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.27', 'BSB', 'when your dread comes like a storm, and your destruction like a whirlwind, when distress and anguish overwhelm you.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.28', 'BSB', 'Then they will call on me, but I will not answer; they will earnestly seek me, but will not find me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.29', 'BSB', 'For they hated knowledge and chose not to fear the LORD.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.30', 'BSB', 'They accepted none of my counsel; they despised all my reproof.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.31', 'BSB', 'So they will eat the fruit of their own way, and be filled with their own devices.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.32', 'BSB', 'For the waywardness of the simple will slay them, and the complacency of fools will destroy them.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.1.33', 'BSB', 'But whoever listens to me will dwell in safety, secure from the fear of evil.”', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.1', 'BSB', 'My son, if you accept my words and hide my commandments within you,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.2', 'BSB', 'if you incline your ear to wisdom and direct your heart to understanding,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.3', 'BSB', 'if you truly call out to insight and lift your voice to understanding,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.4', 'BSB', 'if you seek it like silver and search it out like hidden treasure,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.5', 'BSB', 'then you will discern the fear of the LORD and discover the knowledge of God.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.6', 'BSB', 'For the LORD gives wisdom; from His mouth come knowledge and understanding.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.7', 'BSB', 'He stores up sound wisdom for the upright; He is a shield to those who walk with integrity,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.8', 'BSB', 'to guard the paths of justice and protect the way of His saints.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.9', 'BSB', 'Then you will discern righteousness and justice and equity—every good path.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.10', 'BSB', 'For wisdom will enter your heart, and knowledge will delight your soul.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.11', 'BSB', 'Discretion will watch over you, and understanding will guard you,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.12', 'BSB', 'to deliver you from the way of evil, from the man who speaks perversity,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.13', 'BSB', 'from those who leave the straight paths to walk in the ways of darkness,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.14', 'BSB', 'from those who enjoy doing evil and rejoice in the twistedness of evil,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.15', 'BSB', 'whose paths are crooked and whose ways are devious.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.16', 'BSB', 'It will rescue you from the forbidden woman, from the stranger with seductive words', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.17', 'BSB', 'who abandons the partner of her youth and forgets the covenant of her God.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.18', 'BSB', 'For her house sinks down to death, and her tracks to the departed spirits.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.19', 'BSB', 'None who go to her return or negotiate the paths of life.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.20', 'BSB', 'So you will follow in the ways of the good, and keep to the paths of the righteous.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.21', 'BSB', 'For the upright will inhabit the land, and the blameless will remain in it;', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.2.22', 'BSB', 'but the wicked will be cut off from the land, and the unfaithful will be uprooted.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.1', 'BSB', 'My son, do not forget my teaching, but let your heart keep my commandments;', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.2', 'BSB', 'for they will add length to your days, years and peace to your life.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.3', 'BSB', 'Never let loving devotion or faithfulness leave you; bind them around your neck, write them on the tablet of your heart.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.4', 'BSB', 'Then you will find favor and high regard in the sight of God and man.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.5', 'BSB', 'Trust in the LORD with all your heart, and lean not on your own understanding;', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.6', 'BSB', 'in all your ways acknowledge Him, and He will make your paths straight.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.7', 'BSB', 'Be not wise in your own eyes; fear the LORD and turn away from evil.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.8', 'BSB', 'This will bring healing to your body and refreshment to your bones.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.9', 'BSB', 'Honor the LORD with your wealth and with the firstfruits of all your harvest;', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.10', 'BSB', 'then your barns will be filled with plenty, and your vats will overflow with new wine.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.11', 'BSB', 'My son, do not reject the discipline of the LORD, and do not loathe His rebuke;', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.12', 'BSB', 'for the LORD disciplines the one He loves, as does a father the son in whom he delights.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.13', 'BSB', 'Blessed is the man who finds wisdom, the man who acquires understanding,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.14', 'BSB', 'for she is more profitable than silver, and her gain is better than fine gold.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.15', 'BSB', 'She is more precious than rubies; nothing you desire compares with her.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.16', 'BSB', 'Long life is in her right hand; in her left hand are riches and honor.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.17', 'BSB', 'All her ways are pleasant, and all her paths are peaceful.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.18', 'BSB', 'She is a tree of life to those who embrace her, and those who lay hold of her are blessed.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.19', 'BSB', 'The LORD founded the earth by wisdom and established the heavens by understanding.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.20', 'BSB', 'By His knowledge the watery depths were broken open, and the clouds dripped with dew.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.21', 'BSB', 'My son, do not lose sight of this: Preserve sound judgment and discernment.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.22', 'BSB', 'They will be life to your soul and adornment to your neck.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.23', 'BSB', 'Then you will go on your way in safety, and your foot will not stumble.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.24', 'BSB', 'When you lie down, you will not be afraid; when you rest, your sleep will be sweet.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.25', 'BSB', 'Do not fear sudden danger or the ruin that overtakes the wicked,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.26', 'BSB', 'for the LORD will be your confidence and will keep your foot from the snare.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.27', 'BSB', 'Do not withhold good from the deserving when it is within your power to act.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.28', 'BSB', 'Do not tell your neighbor, “Come back tomorrow and I will provide”— when you already have the means.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.29', 'BSB', 'Do not devise evil against your neighbor, for he trustfully dwells beside you.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.30', 'BSB', 'Do not accuse a man without cause, when he has done you no harm.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.31', 'BSB', 'Do not envy a violent man or choose any of his ways;', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.32', 'BSB', 'for the LORD detests the perverse, but He is a friend to the upright.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.33', 'BSB', 'The curse of the LORD is on the house of the wicked, but He blesses the home of the righteous.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.34', 'BSB', 'He mocks the mockers, but gives grace to the humble.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.3.35', 'BSB', 'The wise will inherit honor, but fools are held up to shame.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.1', 'BSB', 'Listen, my sons, to a father’s instruction; pay attention and gain understanding.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.2', 'BSB', 'For I give you sound teaching; do not abandon my directive.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.3', 'BSB', 'When I was a son to my father, tender and the only child of my mother,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.4', 'BSB', 'he taught me and said, “Let your heart lay hold of my words; keep my commands and you will live.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.5', 'BSB', 'Get wisdom, get understanding; do not forget my words or turn from them.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.6', 'BSB', 'Do not forsake wisdom, and she will preserve you; love her, and she will guard you.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.7', 'BSB', 'Wisdom is supreme; so acquire wisdom. And whatever you may acquire, gain understanding.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.8', 'BSB', 'Prize her, and she will exalt you; if you embrace her, she will honor you.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.9', 'BSB', 'She will set a garland of grace on your head; she will present you with a crown of beauty.”', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.10', 'BSB', 'Listen, my son, and receive my words, and the years of your life will be many.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.11', 'BSB', 'I will guide you in the way of wisdom; I will lead you on straight paths.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.12', 'BSB', 'When you walk, your steps will not be impeded; when you run, you will not stumble.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.13', 'BSB', 'Hold on to instruction; do not let go. Guard it, for it is your life.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.14', 'BSB', 'Do not set foot on the path of the wicked or walk in the way of evildoers.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.15', 'BSB', 'Avoid it; do not travel on it. Turn from it and pass on by.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.16', 'BSB', 'For they cannot sleep unless they do evil; they are deprived of slumber until they make someone fall.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.17', 'BSB', 'For they eat the bread of wickedness and drink the wine of violence.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.18', 'BSB', 'The path of the righteous is like the first gleam of dawn, shining brighter and brighter until midday.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.19', 'BSB', 'But the way of the wicked is like the darkest gloom; they do not know what makes them stumble.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.20', 'BSB', 'My son, pay attention to my words; incline your ear to my sayings.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.21', 'BSB', 'Do not lose sight of them; keep them within your heart.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.22', 'BSB', 'For they are life to those who find them, and health to the whole body.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.23', 'BSB', 'Guard your heart with all diligence, for from it flow springs of life.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.24', 'BSB', 'Put away deception from your mouth; keep your lips from perverse speech.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.25', 'BSB', 'Let your eyes look forward; fix your gaze straight ahead.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.26', 'BSB', 'Make a level path for your feet, and all your ways will be sure.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.4.27', 'BSB', 'Do not swerve to the right or to the left; turn your feet away from evil.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.1', 'BSB', 'My son, pay attention to my wisdom; incline your ear to my insight,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.2', 'BSB', 'that you may maintain discretion and your lips may preserve knowledge.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.3', 'BSB', 'Though the lips of the forbidden woman drip honey and her speech is smoother than oil,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.4', 'BSB', 'in the end she is bitter as wormwood, sharp as a double-edged sword.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.5', 'BSB', 'Her feet go down to death; her steps lead straight to Sheol.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.6', 'BSB', 'She does not consider the path of life; she does not know that her ways are unstable.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.7', 'BSB', 'So now, my sons, listen to me, and do not turn aside from the words of my mouth.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.8', 'BSB', 'Keep your path far from her; do not go near the door of her house,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.9', 'BSB', 'lest you concede your vigor to others, and your years to one who is cruel;', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.10', 'BSB', 'lest strangers feast on your wealth, and your labors enrich the house of a foreigner.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.11', 'BSB', 'At the end of your life you will groan when your flesh and your body are spent,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.12', 'BSB', 'and you will say, “How I hated discipline, and my heart despised reproof!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.13', 'BSB', 'I did not listen to the voice of my teachers or incline my ear to my mentors.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.14', 'BSB', 'I am on the brink of utter ruin in the midst of the whole assembly.”', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.15', 'BSB', 'Drink water from your own cistern, and running water from your own well.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.16', 'BSB', 'Why should your springs flow in the streets, your streams of water in the public squares?', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.17', 'BSB', 'Let them be yours alone, never to be shared with strangers.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.18', 'BSB', 'May your fountain be blessed, and may you rejoice in the wife of your youth:', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.19', 'BSB', 'A loving doe, a graceful fawn— may her breasts satisfy you always; may you be captivated by her love forever.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.20', 'BSB', 'Why be captivated, my son, by an adulteress, or embrace the bosom of a stranger?', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.21', 'BSB', 'For a man’s ways are before the eyes of the LORD, and the LORD examines all his paths.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.22', 'BSB', 'The iniquities of a wicked man entrap him; the cords of his sin entangle him.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.5.23', 'BSB', 'He dies for lack of discipline, led astray by his own great folly.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.1', 'BSB', 'My son, if you have put up security for your neighbor, if you have struck hands in pledge with a stranger,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.2', 'BSB', 'if you have been trapped by the words of your lips, ensnared by the words of your mouth,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.3', 'BSB', 'then do this, my son, to free yourself, for you have fallen into your neighbor’s hands: Go, humble yourself, and press your plea with your neighbor.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.4', 'BSB', 'Allow no sleep to your eyes or slumber to your eyelids.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.5', 'BSB', 'Free yourself, like a gazelle from the hand of the hunter, like a bird from the snare of the fowler.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.6', 'BSB', 'Walk in the manner of the ant, O slacker; observe its ways and become wise.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.7', 'BSB', 'Without a commander, without an overseer or ruler,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.8', 'BSB', 'it prepares its provisions in summer; it gathers its food at harvest.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.9', 'BSB', 'How long will you lie there, O slacker? When will you get up from your sleep?', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.10', 'BSB', 'A little sleep, a little slumber, a little folding of the hands to rest,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.11', 'BSB', 'and poverty will come upon you like a robber, and need like a bandit.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.12', 'BSB', 'A worthless person, a wicked man, walks with a perverse mouth,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.13', 'BSB', 'winking his eyes, speaking with his feet, and pointing with his fingers.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.14', 'BSB', 'With deceit in his heart he devises evil; he continually sows discord.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.15', 'BSB', 'Therefore calamity will come upon him suddenly; in an instant he will be shattered beyond recovery.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.16', 'BSB', 'There are six things that the LORD hates, seven that are detestable to Him:', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.17', 'BSB', 'haughty eyes, a lying tongue, hands that shed innocent blood,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.18', 'BSB', 'a heart that devises wicked schemes, feet that run swiftly to evil,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.19', 'BSB', 'a false witness who gives false testimony, and one who stirs up discord among brothers.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.20', 'BSB', 'My son, keep your father’s commandment, and do not forsake your mother’s teaching.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.21', 'BSB', 'Bind them always upon your heart; tie them around your neck.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.22', 'BSB', 'When you walk, they will guide you; when you lie down, they will watch over you; when you awake, they will speak to you.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.23', 'BSB', 'For this commandment is a lamp, this teaching is a light, and the reproofs of discipline are the way to life,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.24', 'BSB', 'to keep you from the evil woman, from the smooth tongue of the adulteress.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.25', 'BSB', 'Do not lust in your heart for her beauty or let her captivate you with her eyes.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.26', 'BSB', 'For the levy of the prostitute is poverty, and the adulteress preys upon your very life.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.27', 'BSB', 'Can a man embrace fire and his clothes not be burned?', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.28', 'BSB', 'Can a man walk on hot coals without scorching his feet?', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.29', 'BSB', 'So is he who sleeps with another man’s wife; no one who touches her will go unpunished.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.30', 'BSB', 'Men do not despise the thief if he steals to satisfy his hunger.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.31', 'BSB', 'Yet if caught, he must pay sevenfold; he must give up all the wealth of his house.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.32', 'BSB', 'He who commits adultery lacks judgment; whoever does so destroys himself.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.33', 'BSB', 'Wounds and dishonor will befall him, and his reproach will never be wiped away.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.34', 'BSB', 'For jealousy enrages a husband, and he will show no mercy in the day of vengeance.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.6.35', 'BSB', 'He will not be appeased by any ransom, or persuaded by lavish gifts.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.1', 'BSB', 'My son, keep my words and treasure my commandments within you.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.2', 'BSB', 'Keep my commandments and live; guard my teachings as the apple of your eye.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.3', 'BSB', 'Tie them to your fingers; write them on the tablet of your heart.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.4', 'BSB', 'Say to wisdom, “You are my sister,” and call understanding your kinsman,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.5', 'BSB', 'that they may keep you from the adulteress, from the stranger with seductive words.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.6', 'BSB', 'For at the window of my house I looked through the lattice.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.7', 'BSB', 'I saw among the simple, I noticed among the youths, a young man lacking judgment,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.8', 'BSB', 'crossing the street near her corner, strolling down the road to her house,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.9', 'BSB', 'at twilight, as the day was fading into the dark of the night.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.10', 'BSB', 'Then a woman came out to meet him, with the attire of a harlot and cunning of heart.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.11', 'BSB', 'She is loud and defiant; her feet do not remain at home.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.12', 'BSB', 'Now in the street, now in the squares, she lurks at every corner.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.13', 'BSB', 'She seizes him and kisses him; she brazenly says to him:', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.14', 'BSB', '“I have made my peace offerings; today I have paid my vows.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.15', 'BSB', 'So I came out to meet you; I sought you, and I have found you.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.16', 'BSB', 'I have decked my bed with coverings, with colored linen from Egypt.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.17', 'BSB', 'I have perfumed my bed with myrrh, with aloes, and with cinnamon.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.18', 'BSB', 'Come, let us take our fill of love till morning. Let us delight in loving caresses!', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.19', 'BSB', 'For my husband is not at home; he has gone on a long journey.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.20', 'BSB', 'He took with him a bag of money and will not return till the moon is full.”', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.21', 'BSB', 'With her great persuasion she entices him; with her flattering lips she lures him.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.22', 'BSB', 'He follows her on impulse, like an ox going to the slaughter, like a deer bounding into a trap,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.23', 'BSB', 'until an arrow pierces his liver, like a bird darting into a snare— not knowing it will cost him his life.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.24', 'BSB', 'Now, my sons, listen to me, and attend to the words of my mouth.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.25', 'BSB', 'Do not let your heart turn aside to her ways; do not stray into her paths.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.26', 'BSB', 'For she has brought many down to death; her slain are many in number.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.7.27', 'BSB', 'Her house is the road to Sheol, descending to the chambers of death.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.1', 'BSB', 'Does not wisdom call out, and understanding raise her voice?', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.2', 'BSB', 'On the heights overlooking the road, at the crossroads she takes her stand.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.3', 'BSB', 'Beside the gates to the city, at the entrances she cries out:', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.4', 'BSB', '“To you, O men, I call out, and my cry is to the sons of men.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.5', 'BSB', 'O simple ones, learn to be shrewd; O fools, gain understanding.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.6', 'BSB', 'Listen, for I speak of noble things, and the opening of my lips will reveal right.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.7', 'BSB', 'For my mouth will speak the truth, and wickedness is detestable to my lips.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.8', 'BSB', 'All the words of my mouth are righteous; none are crooked or perverse.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.9', 'BSB', 'They are all plain to the discerning, and upright to those who find knowledge.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.10', 'BSB', 'Receive my instruction instead of silver, and knowledge rather than pure gold.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.11', 'BSB', 'For wisdom is more precious than rubies, and nothing you desire compares with her.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.12', 'BSB', 'I, wisdom, dwell together with prudence, and I find knowledge and discretion.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.13', 'BSB', 'To fear the LORD is to hate evil; I hate arrogant pride, evil conduct, and perverse speech.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.14', 'BSB', 'Counsel and sound judgment are mine; I have insight and strength.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.15', 'BSB', 'By me kings reign, and rulers enact just laws;', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.16', 'BSB', 'By me princes rule, and all nobles who govern justly.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.17', 'BSB', 'I love those who love me, and those who seek me early shall find me.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.18', 'BSB', 'With me are riches and honor, enduring wealth and righteousness.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.19', 'BSB', 'My fruit is better than gold, pure gold, and my harvest surpasses choice silver.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.20', 'BSB', 'I walk in the way of righteousness, along the paths of justice,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.21', 'BSB', 'bestowing wealth on those who love me and making their treasuries full.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.22', 'BSB', 'The LORD created me as His first course, before His works of old.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.23', 'BSB', 'From everlasting I was established, from the beginning, before the earth began.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.24', 'BSB', 'When there were no watery depths, I was brought forth, when no springs were overflowing with water.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.25', 'BSB', 'Before the mountains were settled, before the hills, I was brought forth,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.26', 'BSB', 'before He made the land or fields, or any of the dust of the earth.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.27', 'BSB', 'I was there when He established the heavens, when He inscribed a circle on the face of the deep,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.28', 'BSB', 'when He established the clouds above, when the fountains of the deep gushed forth,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.29', 'BSB', 'when He set a boundary for the sea, so that the waters would not surpass His command, when He marked out the foundations of the earth.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.30', 'BSB', 'Then I was a skilled craftsman at His side, and His delight day by day, rejoicing always in His presence.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.31', 'BSB', 'I was rejoicing in His whole world, delighting together in the sons of men.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.32', 'BSB', 'Now therefore, my sons, listen to me, for blessed are those who keep my ways.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.33', 'BSB', 'Listen to instruction and be wise; do not ignore it.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.34', 'BSB', 'Blessed is the man who listens to me, watching daily at my doors, waiting at the posts of my doorway.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.35', 'BSB', 'For whoever finds me finds life and obtains the favor of the LORD.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.8.36', 'BSB', 'But he who fails to find me harms himself; all who hate me love death.”', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.9.1', 'BSB', 'Wisdom has built her house; she has carved out her seven pillars.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.9.2', 'BSB', 'She has prepared her meat and mixed her wine; she has also set her table.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.9.3', 'BSB', 'She has sent out her maidservants; she calls out from the heights of the city.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.9.4', 'BSB', '“Whoever is simple, let him turn in here!” she says to him who lacks judgment.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.9.5', 'BSB', '“Come, eat my bread and drink the wine I have mixed.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.9.6', 'BSB', 'Leave your folly behind, and you will live; walk in the way of understanding.”', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.9.7', 'BSB', 'He who corrects a mocker brings shame on himself; he who rebukes a wicked man taints himself.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.9.8', 'BSB', 'Do not rebuke a mocker, or he will hate you; rebuke a wise man, and he will love you.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.9.9', 'BSB', 'Instruct a wise man, and he will be wiser still; teach a righteous man, and he will increase his learning.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.9.10', 'BSB', 'The fear of the LORD is the beginning of wisdom, and knowledge of the Holy One is understanding.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.9.11', 'BSB', 'For through wisdom your days will be multiplied, and years will be added to your life.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.9.12', 'BSB', 'If you are wise, you are wise to your own advantage; but if you scoff, you alone will bear the consequences.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.9.13', 'BSB', 'The woman named Folly is loud; she is naive and knows nothing.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.9.14', 'BSB', 'She sits at the door of her house, on a seat in the heights of the city,', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.9.15', 'BSB', 'calling out to those who pass by, who make their paths straight.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.9.16', 'BSB', '“Whoever is simple, let him turn in here!” she says to him who lacks judgment.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.9.17', 'BSB', '“Stolen water is sweet, and bread eaten in secret is tasty!”', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.9.18', 'BSB', 'But they do not know that the dead are there, that her guests are in the depths of Sheol.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.10.1', 'BSB', 'The proverbs of Solomon: A wise son brings joy to his father, but a foolish son grief to his mother.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.10.2', 'BSB', 'Ill-gotten treasures profit nothing, but righteousness brings deliverance from death.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.10.3', 'BSB', 'The LORD does not let the righteous go hungry, but He denies the craving of the wicked.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
('Prov.10.4', 'BSB', 'Idle hands make one poor, but diligent hands bring wealth.', 'Public domain', 'Berean Standard Bible (BSB); full notice in bible.translation', 'as imported', NULL),
